  "anchor": "Plan v25 Block 1 — per-country SMB baseline. Used by synthesizeCell() when no real cell row exists. Conservative country-level averages: median annual payroll per employee (USD-equivalent), typical revenue-per-firm multiplier (relative to global SMB median), and the local currency symbol the UI should render. Source: internal cross-reference of OECD wage data + national stats bureaus, normalized to 2024 USD. Values are deliberately coarse — they're defaults, not measurements. R-002: no source-agency names in user-visible text; internal_source field is internal only.",
